<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech 26-wk T-bill yields 12.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech 26-wk T-bill yields 12.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in a Czech National Bank Dutch auction offering 5.3 billion crowns in 26-week finance ministry treasury bills was 12.23 percent on Wednesday, the CNB said.</p>
<p>The issue was oversubscribed with bids totalling 12.963 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Prague newsroom +422 2423 0003</p>
</text>
